#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/wrap-up.rst:2
msgid "Wrap up"
msgstr "總結"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/wrap-up.rst:4
msgid ""
"That is OpenMV Viewer: connect a camera, run a product's script, and watch "
"its frame buffer, serial output, and histogram live -- the parts of OpenMV "
"IDE that show what a camera is doing, with the development tools taken away."
" It is the application to reach for when the job is to *present* a finished "
"OpenMV product rather than build one."
msgstr ""
"這就是 OpenMV Viewer：連接相機、執行產品的腳本，並即時觀看它的影格緩衝區、序列輸出與直方圖——也就是 OpenMV IDE "
"中顯示相機運作狀態的部分，只是拿掉了開發工具。當任務是要*呈現*一個已完成的 OpenMV 產品而非建置它時，這就是你該使用的應用程式。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/wrap-up.rst:12
msgid ""
"When you do need to change the application -- edit the script, tune a "
"threshold, retrain a model, adjust settings -- reach for the full "
":doc:`OpenMV IDE <../ide/index>`. The two install side by side, so a "
"development machine can carry both: build in the IDE, demonstrate in the "
"Viewer."
msgstr ""
"當你確實需要變更應用程式時——編輯腳本、調校閾值、重新訓練模型、調整設定——請使用完整的 :doc:`OpenMV IDE "
"<../ide/index>`。兩者可並存安裝，因此一台開發機器可同時具備兩者：在 IDE 中建置，在 Viewer 中展示。"
